Shyne had major music decisions to make 👀

@shyne_bz took on the ‘Sound Check’ challenge, choosing between tracks from some of music’s most legendary artists, including Raekwon vs. DMX, Nas vs. Kanye West, Bob Marley and the Wailers vs. Boogie Down Productions, and more. Will @jeremy_hecht be able to guess Shyne’s anthem? Watch the video to find out.

